<title>USA: Orbotech completes sale of Opal shares.</title>
<headline>Orbotech completes sale of Opal shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orbotech Ltd said Monday it received $23 million for Opal Inc shares which, after taxes, would give it a net gain of about $8 million in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it tendered all of its 1,241,650 shares of common stock of Opal to Applied Materials Inc pursuant to Applied's public tender offer to purchase all of Opal shares at a price of $18.50 per share.</p>
</text>
